				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e4dfdb3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="e4dfdb3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div style='font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.9; text-align: justify;'><h3><span style='color: #000000;'>Abuja No.1 ICT Online Shopping Destination</span></h3><p><span style='color: #000000;'><span style='letter-spacing: -0.01em;'>Welcome to <strong>Foretec Investment Limited (Foretec Online)</strong> your trustedone-stop ICT store in Abuja. Conveniently located at <strong>Old Banex Plaza, Wuse 2</strong>, we provide genuine, high-quality technology products and professional IT solutions for individuals, businesses, schools, and government organizations across Nigeria. We stock a wide range of <strong>brand-new </strong><a href='https://foreteconline.com/laptops/'>Laptops</a>, <a href='https://foreteconline.com/desktops/'>Desktops</a>, <a href='https://foreteconline.com/printers/'>Printers</a>, <a href='https://foreteconline.com/scanners/'>Scanners</a>, <a href='https://foreteconline.com/networking/'>Network devices</a>,<a href='https://foreteconline.com/storage/'> Storage devices</a>, <a href='https://foreteconline.com/projector/'>Projectors</a>, <a href='https://foreteconline.com/accessories/'>Computer Accessories</a> and other ICT products from leading global brands including <strong>HP, Dell, Lenovo, Apple, Canon, Epson, TP-Link, JBL, Logitech</strong>, and many more.</span></span></p><p><span style='color: #000000;'><span style='letter-spacing: -0.01em;'>Beyond product sales, our experience technical team delivers reliable ICT services, including: Computer assembly and custom PC builds, Laptop and desktop repairs, network installation and configuration, IT support for individuals and businesses across the FCT. At Foretec Online, we believe that buying technology should be simple, affordable, and reliable. That's why we are committed to offering competitive prices, genuine products, exceptional customer service, nationwide delivery, and premium after-sales support. Our services also include a <strong>Lowest Price Guarantee</strong>, a <strong>3-Day Free Return Policy</strong> (terms and conditions apply), dedicated customer support, and other value-added services designed to give you complete peace of mind.</span></span></p><p class='isSelectedEnd'>Customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do. We continuously seek innovative ways to improve your shopping experience, and we value your feedback. We'd love to hear from you at <a href='mailto:help@foreteconline.com'><strong>support@foreteconline.com</strong></a>.</p><p><strong>Thank you for choosing Foretec Online your trusted ICT partner in Abuja and across Nigeria.</strong></p></div>				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				</div>
