tent/uploads/2026/09/logo-106-1-600x386.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 876px) 100vw, 876px\" /\u003E\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003C/a\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ca href=\"https://foreteconline.com/?s=cisco&#038;product_cat=0&#038;post_type=product&#038;v=330a840f8637\"\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Cimg width=\"219\" height=\"141\" src=\"https://foreteconline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-106.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003E\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003C/a\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ca href=\"https://foreteconline.com/routers/\"\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Cimg width=\"876\" height=\"564\" src=\"https://foreteconline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-103-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://foreteconline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-103-1.jpg 876w, https://foreteconline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-103-1-300x193.jpg 300w, https://foreteconline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-103-1-768x494.jpg 768w, https://foreteconline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-103-1-600x386.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 876px) 100vw, 876px\" /\u003E\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003C/a\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ca href=\"https://foreteconline.com/shop/ubiquiti-unifi-wireless-access-point-u6-dual-band/\"\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Cimg width=\"876\" height=\"564\" src=\"https://foreteconline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-104-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://foreteconline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-104-1.jpg 876w, https://foreteconline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-104-1-300x193.jpg 300w, https://foreteconline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-104-1-768x494.jpg 768w, https://foreteconline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-104-1-600x386.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 876px) 100vw, 876px\" /\u003E\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003C/a\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ca href=\"https://foreteconline.com/mercury/\"\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003Cimg width=\"876\" height=\"564\" src=\"https://foreteconline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-101-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://foreteconline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-101-1.jpg 876w, https://foreteconline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-101-1-300x193.jpg 300w, https://foreteconline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-101-1-768x494.jpg 768w, https://foreteconline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logo-101-1-600x386.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 876px) 100vw, 876px\" /\u003E\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003C/a\u003E\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003Ch3\u003EAbuja No.1 ICT Online Shopping Destination\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWelcome to \u003Cstrong\u003EForetec Investment Limited (Foretec Online)\u003C/strong\u003E your trustedone-stop ICT store in Abuja. Conveniently located at \u003Cstrong\u003EOld Banex Plaza, Wuse 2\u003C/strong\u003E, we provide genuine, high-quality technology products and professional IT solutions for individuals, businesses, schools, and government organizations across Nigeria. We stock a wide range of \u003Cstrong\u003Ebrand-new \u003C/strong\u003E\u003Ca href='https://foreteconline.com/laptops/'\u003ELaptops\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href='https://foreteconline.com/desktops/'\u003EDesktops\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href='https://foreteconline.com/printers/'\u003EPrinters\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href='https://foreteconline.com/scanners/'\u003EScanners\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href='https://foreteconline.com/networking/'\u003ENetwork devices\u003C/a\u003E,\u003Ca href='https://foreteconline.com/storage/'\u003E Storage devices\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href='https://foreteconline.com/projector/'\u003EProjectors\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href='https://foreteconline.com/accessories/'\u003EComputer Accessories\u003C/a\u003E and other ICT products from leading global brands including \u003Cstrong\u003EHP, Dell, Lenovo, Apple, Canon, Epson, TP-Link, JBL, Logitech\u003C/strong\u003E, and many more.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBeyond product sales, our experience technical team delivers reliable ICT services, including: Computer assembly and custom PC builds, Laptop and desktop repairs, network installation and configuration, IT support for individuals and businesses across the FCT. At Foretec Online, we believe that buying technology should be simple, affordable, and reliable. That's why we are committed to offering competitive prices, genuine products, exceptional customer service, nationwide delivery, and premium after-sales support. Our services also include a \u003Cstrong\u003ELowest Price Guarantee\u003C/strong\u003E, a \u003Cstrong\u003E3-Day Free Return Policy\u003C/strong\u003E (terms and conditions apply), dedicated customer support, and other value-added services designed to give you complete peace of mind.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp class='isSelectedEnd'\u003ECustomer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do. We continuously seek innovative ways to improve your shopping experience, and we value your feedback. We'd love to hear from you at \u003Ca href='mailto:help@foreteconline.com'\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Esupport@foreteconline.com\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThank you for choosing Foretec Online your trusted ICT partner in Abuja and across Nigeria.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","post_title":"Foretec | New Homepage Concept","post_excerpt":"","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","post_password":"","post_name":"foretec-new-homepage-concept","to_ping":"","pinged":"","post_modified":"2026-09-24 14:42:37","post_modified_gmt":"2026-09-24 13:42:37","post_content_filtered":"","post_parent":0,"guid":"https://foreteconline.com/foretec-new-homepage-concept/","menu_order":0,"post_type":"page","post_mime_type":"","comment_count":"0","filter":"raw"}};
